{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04058","headline":"人日重宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制 · 苏頲","name":"人日重宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疏龙磴道切昭回，建凤旗门绕帝台。\n七叶仙蓂依月吐，千株御柳拂烟开。\n初年竞贴宜春胜，长命先浮献寿杯。\n是日皇灵知窃幸，羣心就捧大明来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}